    "regime_notes": "Positive H10 IC in all evaluated regimes: 2024-2026 0.095126 (104 dates), 2027-2029 0.055253 (782), 2030-2032 0.027846 (784), 2033-2035 0.076543 (703). Small 15-asset cross-section requires conservative interpretation.",
